desktop.ini


# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#
#   backend/tests/fixtures/*.tei.xml
#     Real GROBID output, committed on purpose. It is what lets the parser
#     suite run in under a second with no Docker and no network. Treat it as
#     source, not as generated data.
#
#   backend/.env.example, frontend/.env.local.example
#     Templates showing which variables exist. No secrets in them.
#
#   frontend/AGENTS.md, frontend/CLAUDE.md
#     Written and re-added automatically by `next dev`. Next's own guidance is
#     to commit them: ignoring them just means they reappear as untracked
#     noise on every run.
